<title>UK: My Kinda Town yr pretax profits slip.</title>
<headline>My Kinda Town yr pretax profits slip.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.3		   vs 10.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.0		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 3.0		    vs 3.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.57		   vs 3.40</p>
<p> Turnover		   31.36		  vs 27.77</p>
<p> Operating result	 3.22		   vs 3.52</p>
<p> Exceptional     charge 0.30		   vs 0.15 gain</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.35		   vs 0.32</p>
<p> Tax			  0.01		   vs 0.94</p>
<p> Net taxed		  2.56		   vs 2.46</p>
<p> Retained profit	  1.80		   vs 1.74</p>
<p> Pay date		   December 6</p>
<p>Note - Restaurant chain operator My Kinda Town Plc said the current financial year had had &quot;an encouraging start.&quot; It said group turnover was ahead of last year and 10 new openings were scheduled.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
